From 8b527e90ff2759bad0039533fe8202f3ca1f25a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Local Build <build@local>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 19:42:43 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] rules/config: disable P4RT docker build by default

Upstream enabled INCLUDE_P4RT=y in sonic-buildimage #27960 (07683ed85).
That change adds docker-sonic-p4rt to default image builds and requires
building sonic-p4rt via Bazel (sonic-pins), which fails in environments
that cannot download Bazel from releases.bazel.build.

Do not revert 07683ed85: keep the sonic-pins submodule bump and the
sonic-p4rt Makefile workaround. Only disable P4RT at the SONiC config
layer so default builds skip sonic-p4rt and docker-sonic-p4rt.

Signed-off-by: Local Build <build@local>
---
 rules/config | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/rules/config b/rules/config
index 40c46fd..c660c2d 100644
--- a/rules/config
+++ b/rules/config
@@ -211,7 +211,7 @@ INCLUDE_DHCP_RELAY = y
 INCLUDE_DHCP_SERVER ?= n
 
 # INCLUDE_P4RT - build docker-p4rt for P4RT support
-INCLUDE_P4RT = y
+INCLUDE_P4RT = n
 
 # INCLUDE_PTF - build docker-ptf and docker-ptf-sai test containers.
 # These are only needed for PTF (Packet Test Framework) testing and are
-- 
2.25.1

